<p>An Air Canada Express regional jet arriving from Montreal collided with a ground vehicle while landing at New York’s LaGuardia Airport late Sunday, prompting a temporary halt to flights and an emergency response. Multiple reports said the aircraft, a Bombardier CRJ-900 operating as Flight 8646, suffered heavy damage to its nose after striking a Port Authority vehicle or fire truck in the runway area. Authorities had not yet publicly explained how the vehicle and aircraft ended up in conflict on the runway, but NDTV reported that air traffic control audio captured warnings telling the truck to stop before impact. The collision disrupted overnight operations and left travelers bracing for delays and cancellations, while emergency crews responded quickly and an investigation appeared likely to follow.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/mPNbS4Jk4e12_Bma7-qAMilNIhpwFeZ0Lh-zP7o3-sslwTQt0MhbS7ViHtvPPJ1w2ppJvO7-ceZBvZhAICqA_v5Oxnk4cqbJH_YNabycaPRc7aQfKsnZhg9qz50MbglCOGHHhR2Cn-8GXTo1DQEhdWjzrq_hs9w0-0YWsuVwaUjWTBD5AXoN21ygcTBL_Ovzvg' alt='Damaged Air Canada Express aircraft after the collision at LaGuardia Airport' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Injury reports: NDTV said several people were injured and that four were in critical condition, while other outlets noted multiple victims without confirming a final toll.</li><li>Speed estimate: Flight-tracking site Flightradar24 said the CRJ-900 was moving at about 39km/h, or 24mph, when data was last recorded before the collision.</li><li>Time of crash: New York firefighters responded at about 11:38pm local time after reports that a plane had struck a vehicle on the runway.</li><li>Aircraft route: The plane was operating an international regional service from Montreal to New York before the runway accident.</li></ul><blockquote>Stop, stop, stop - Air traffic control</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Air traffic control: Controllers were heard warning the ground vehicle to stop before the collision, suggesting concern grew in the final seconds before impact. (<a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/air-canada-express-crash-new-york-laguardia-airport-air-traffic-told-truck-before-crash-with-air-canada-express-plane-stop-stop-stop-11253063#publisher=newsstand'>NDTV</a>)</li><li>New York City Fire Department: Firefighters treated the incident as an emergency runway collision and dispatched crews after receiving reports at about 11:38pm. (<a href='https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/mar/23/air-canada-plane-collides-with-ground-vehicle-at-new-yorks-laguardia-airport-halting-all-flights'>The Guardian</a>)</li><li>New York emergency management authorities: Officials warned travelers to expect cancellations and delays as the airport shutdown rippled through flight schedules. (<a href='https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/mar/23/air-canada-plane-collides-with-ground-vehicle-at-new-yorks-laguardia-airport-halting-all-flights'>The Guardian</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/air-canada-express-plane-collides-with-ground-vehicle-at-new-yorks-la-guardia-airport-many-injured-11252852#publisher=newsstand'>Air Canada Express Plane, Truck Collide On New York&#x27;s LaGuardia Airport Runway, 4 Critical</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cy01g522ww4o'>Plane and ground vehicle collide at New York&#x27;s LaGuardia airport halting flights</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/3/23/air-canada-jet-collides-with-ground-vehicle-at-new-york-airport'>Air Canada jet collides with ground vehicle at New York airport</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/united-states-canada/article/3347545/air-canada-express-jet-hits-ground-vehicle-new-yorks-la-guardia-airport'>Air Canada Express jet hits vehicle at New York’s LaGuardia airport</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/air-canada-express-plane-hits-ground-vehicle-at-new-yorks-la-guardia